    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n110390" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φάσγαν-ον</span></b> , τό, poet.
		Noun, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>sword,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δῶκεν μέγα φ. ἥρως σὺν κολεῷ τε
					φέρων καὶ ἐϋτμήτῳ τελαμῶνι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					23.824
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κολεοῦ γυμνὸν φ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>N.</u>
					1.52b
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμφιπλῆγι φ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Tr.</u>
					930
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				373
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Cypr.
			</span></i> acc. to <i><span class="en">
				<u>AB</u>
				1095
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξιφίον</span>
			, <i>corn-flag, Gladiolus segetum,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				7.12.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				7.13.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				74.63
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξάνθιον</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				4.136
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀσπάλαθος</span>
			, 
				f.l. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σφάγνον</span>
			 in <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				1.20
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξίφος</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				11
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>H.</u>
				3.556
			</span></i>.</div>
